// Real-agent BasicSummon (the `find_familiar.ron` shape), not the
// `unseen_servant.ron` phantasm: unlike `helpful_homunculi.ron` (explicitly
// "intangible, invulnerable"), this spell's sheet describes a real, solid
// "loyal companion" with no such qualifier, so it keeps
// `alignment`/`with_agent`/`incorporeal`/`phantom_illusion` at their
// `#[serde(default)]` values (owned, agentic, solid, real) and
// `duration: None` for a permanent bond, matching "the construct persists."
// `body: Golem(Mogwai)` reuses `helpful_homunculi.ron`'s "tiny magical
// construct" body -- same visual scale, different agency/durability shape.
//
// Same known gap as `find_familiar.ron`: `BasicSummon`'s `CreateNpcEvent`
// path never populates `comp::Pet`, so this servant will NOT survive a
// logout/server-restart and isn't chunk-unload-protected.
BasicSummon(
    buildup_duration: 1.0,
    cast_duration: 0.5,
    recover_duration: 0.4,
    summon_info: Npc(
        summoned_amount: 1,
        summon_distance: (1.0, 2.0),
        body: Golem((species: Mogwai, body_type: Male)),
        scale: None,
        has_health: true,
        use_npc_name: true,
        loadout_config: None,
        skillset_config: None,
        duration: None,
    ),
)
